    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but is it really a distortion though? like, if i'm actually making their lives harder, isn't that just the reality? it feels so much more loving to protect them from me than it does to stay and keep making them suffer. it's like... if i loved them as much as i say i do, wouldn't i want to take the burden away from them for good?",
